source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: Jira pairs the inner braces and leaves the outer ones literal; jiro opens at the first `{{` and keeps the extra braces in the code body.
-- input.jira --
{{{{a}}}}
-- rendered.html --
<p>{{<tt>a</tt>}}</p>
-- want.md --
`{{a`}}
-- warnings.json --
[]
